## Interface: 16001
## Title: MMT - Quality of life
## Notes: MMT module: small team conveniences. Keeps Dejunk's junk lists and Baganator's category items the same on every character of the team. Sends ForeverAuras auras and EllesmereUI profiles to the team, calls out SmartBuff alerts, lets RestedXP Guides wait for the party before its next step, and leaves Dejunk / Baganator junk on the corpse as master looter.
## Version: 1.3.0
## Author: Quiding
## X-Repository: https://github.com/Quiding/mmt_modules
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## Dependencies: MMT
## DefaultState: disabled
## X-MMT-DefaultState: disabled
## OptionalDeps: MMT_LootDistribution, Dejunk, Baganator, ForeverAuras, EllesmereUI, SmartBuff, RXPGuides
## X-MMT-Module: 1
## X-MMT-Title: Quality of life
